sequenceDiagram
    participant M as Master
    participant R as Replica
    participant O as Other Nodes

    Note over M: Master fails
    R->>R: Detect master failure
    R->>O: Request failover votes
    O->>R: Provide votes

    R->>R: Achieves quorum
    R->>R: Promotes to master
    R->>O: PONG with master flag
    O->>O: Update configuration

    Note over M: Master recovers later
    M->>O: Rejoin as replica